  "name": "Sun-Dried Tomato Pesto",
  "subtitle": "A tangy, herb-filled spread with Parmesan and pine nuts",
  "description": "Blend sun-dried tomatoes with herbs, aromatics, vinegar, and wine, then finish with olive oil and Parmesan for a savory Italian-inspired spread.",
